      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start. The points are solid. \n\nOne thing though—the \"User-Centricity\" score for this one actually came back a bit lower than I expected. I think it's because the summary feels a little \"product-focused\" rather than \"user-focused.\" \n\nCan you try rewriting it? Try to really drive home that we are talking about the people using the app. I know I said don't overdo it, but if we want this to rank highly in the tool, we need the summary to be much more centered on the perspective of the users and the customers. Just make it sound like we're truly empathizing with them.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
